CHAPTER.VERS:
Bless Yahweh, you

          {+}
         his angels, Who are mighty in strength, that fulfill his word, Listening to the voice of his word.

Bless Yahweh, all you

          {+}
         his hosts, You

          {+}
         ministers of his, that do his pleasure.

Bless Yahweh, all you

          {+}
         his works, In all places of his dominion: Bless Yahweh, O my soul.
